# Food Ordering System - Java

## Description

A simple Java console application that allows users to view a food
menu, select food items, enter quantity, and calculate the total bill.

## Features

- Display food menu
- Select food item
- Enter quantity
- Calculate total bill
- Order validation
- Testbench included

## Technologies Used

- Java
- Scanner
- Arrays
- Methods
- Conditional Statements

## Project Structure

Food-Ordering-System-Java/
├── FoodOrderingSystem.java
├── FoodOrderingTest.java
├── README.md
└── .gitignore

## How to Run

Compile:

javac FoodOrderingSystem.java FoodOrderingTest.java

Run:

java FoodOrderingSystem

Run Testbench:

java FoodOrderingTest

## Sample Output

===== FOOD ORDERING SYSTEM =====

===== FOOD MENU =====
1. Pizza - Rs.200
2. Burger - Rs.100
3. Biryani - Rs.180
4. Sandwich - Rs.80

